"""로블록스 대상 진단 (클릭은 하지 않음): 앞으로 가져오기 → 클릭 지점이 실제로 로블록스 것이 되는 시점 측정."""
import ctypes
import importlib.machinery
import importlib.util
import json
import time
from ctypes import wintypes

SRC = r"C:\Users\alfm1\Desktop\Claude\click-macro\click_macro.pyw"
CFG = r"C:\Users\alfm1\Desktop\Claude\click-macro\click_config.json"

loader = importlib.machinery.SourceFileLoader("click_macro", SRC)
spec = importlib.util.spec_from_loader("click_macro", loader)
cm = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)
loader.exec_module(cm)
u = cm.user32
u.GetClassNameW.argtypes = [wintypes.HWND, wintypes.LPWSTR, ctypes.c_int]
u.GetWindowLongW.argtypes = [wintypes.HWND, ctypes.c_int]
u.GetWindowRect.argtypes = [wintypes.HWND, ctypes.POINTER(wintypes.RECT)]


def info(h):
    if not h:
        return "(없음)"
    t = ctypes.create_unicode_buffer(200)
    c = ctypes.create_unicode_buffer(200)
    u.GetWindowTextW(h, t, 200)
    u.GetClassNameW(h, c, 200)
    topmost = bool(u.GetWindowLongW(h, -20) & 0x8)
    return f"[{cm._exe_name(cm._pid_of(h))} | class={c.value} | title={t.value[:30]!r} | 항상위={topmost}]"


def root_at(pt):
    return u.GetAncestor(u.WindowFromPoint(pt), cm.GA_ROOT)


with open(CFG, encoding="utf-8") as f:
    cfg = json.load(f)
print("설정:", cfg)

wins = cm.list_windows()
same = [w for w in wins if w[2].lower() == cfg["target"]["exe"].lower()]
print(f"대상 exe 창 수: {len(same)} -> {[(w[1]) for w in same]}")
w = cm.match_window(wins, cfg["target"]["exe"], cfg["target"]["title"])
if not w or not cfg.get("pos"):
    raise SystemExit("대상 창 또는 클릭 위치 없음")
hwnd = w[0]
rx, ry = cfg["pos"]

prev_fg = u.GetForegroundWindow()
was_min = bool(u.IsIconic(hwnd))
wr = wintypes.RECT()
u.GetWindowRect(hwnd, ctypes.byref(wr))
print("대상:", info(hwnd), f"최소화={was_min} 창영역=({wr.left},{wr.top})-({wr.right},{wr.bottom})")
print("현재 맨 앞:", info(prev_fg))

t0 = time.monotonic()
if was_min:
    u.ShowWindow(hwnd, cm.SW_RESTORE)
    time.sleep(cm.RESTORE_SEC)
u.keybd_event(cm.VK_MENU, 0, 0, 0)
ret = u.SetForegroundWindow(hwnd)
u.keybd_event(cm.VK_MENU, 0, cm.KEYEVENTF_KEYUP, 0)
print(f"SetForegroundWindow 반환={ret}")

fg_at = top_at = None
last_state = None
while time.monotonic() - t0 < 2.5:
    rect = wintypes.RECT()
    u.GetClientRect(hwnd, ctypes.byref(rect))
    pt = wintypes.POINT(int(rect.right * rx), int(rect.bottom * ry))
    u.ClientToScreen(hwnd, ctypes.byref(pt))
    fg = u.GetForegroundWindow()
    root = root_at(pt)
    now = time.monotonic() - t0
    state = (fg, root, rect.right, rect.bottom)
    if state != last_state:
        print(f"  t={now:.3f}s  맨앞==대상:{fg == hwnd}  지점의 창==대상:{root == hwnd}  "
              f"안쪽크기={rect.right}x{rect.bottom} 지점=({pt.x},{pt.y})  지점의 창={info(root) if root != hwnd else '대상'}")
        last_state = state
    if fg_at is None and fg == hwnd:
        fg_at = now
    if top_at is None and root == hwnd:
        top_at = now
    time.sleep(0.005)

print(f"맨 앞이 된 시점: {fg_at}  /  클릭 지점이 대상 창이 된 시점: {top_at}")

if was_min:
    u.ShowWindow(hwnd, cm.SW_MINIMIZE)
if prev_fg and prev_fg != hwnd:
    print("원래 창 복귀:", cm._activate(prev_fg))
